This package is a fork of dsh-context by bowenliang123, used under the
Apache License 2.0. The original project lives at:

    https://github.com/bowenliang123/dsh-context

Changes from upstream:
  - renamed to @my-dsh/context so it installs alongside the other plugins in
    this repository under one installer;
  - removed the "Plugin Info" card from the context dashboard, along with the
    modules that fed it (client/meta.ts, client/latestVersion.ts,
    client/components/pluginInfo.tsx), its stylesheet rules, and its
    plugin.* i18n keys. This also drops the outbound npm request that
    latestVersion.ts made on render to check for a newer release;
  - let the last card in a wrapper column stretch to its column's height, so
    removing the Plugin Info card does not leave a gap under the shorter
    column (client/styles.ts);
  - added "DOM.Iterable" to tsconfig lib so the strict typecheck passes on
    the TypeScript version pinned here.

Everything else under src/ is upstream's implementation.

